    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins.</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You have Farum inscribed on your person.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Through magical trickery, you convert some of your innate magic to activate Farum. Farum becomes charged, or if it was charged already, your next Runeword applied to a Runic spell does not burn the spell slot. If the duration elapses or regardless whether or not your next Runeword does so, Farum becomes no longer charged after using it.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.pjTWK2jZCEe87Fly]{Effect: Farum Charged}</p>"
